gland/received_events\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/repos\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/DaanHoogland/subscriptions\"},\"open_issues\":185,\"closed_issues\":1302,\"created_at\":\"2021-01-04T09:07:50Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-24T11:01:33Z\",\"node_id\":\"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNjI2NTQzNQ==\"},\"reactions\":{\"total_count\":0,\"+1\":0,\"-1\":0,\"laugh\":0,\"confused\":0,\"heart\":0,\"hooray\":0,\"rocket\":0,\"eyes\":0,\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/cloudstack/issues/9403/reactions\"},\"node_id\":\"I_kwDOAJTq2M6PzGRI\"},{\"id\":2704557148,\"number\":10011,\"state\":\"open\",\"locked\":false,\"title\":\"The lxc instance cannot connect\",\"body\":\"\\u003c!--\\r\\nVerify first that your issue/request is not already reported on GitHub.\\r\\nAlso test if the latest release and main branch are affected too.\\r\\nAlways add information AFTER of these HTML comments, but no need to delete the comments.\\r\\n--\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n##### ISSUE TYPE\\r\\n\\u003c!-- Pick one below and delete the rest --\\u003e\\r\\n * Bug Report\\r\\n\\r\\n##### COMPONENT NAME\\r\\n\\u003c!--\\r\\nCategorize the issue, e.g. API, VR, VPN, UI, etc.\\r\\n--\\u003e\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n\\r\\n##### CLOUDSTACK VERSION\\r\\n\\u003c!--\\r\\nNew line separated list of affected versions, commit ID for issues on main branch.\\r\\n--\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n4.18\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n\\r\\n##### CONFIGURATION\\r\\n\\u003c!--\\r\\nInformation about the configuration if relevant, e.g. basic network, advanced networking, etc.  N/A otherwise\\r\\n--\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\\r\\n\\u003c!--\\r\\nInformation about the environment if relevant, N/A otherwise\\r\\n--\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nubuntu 22.04.5\\r\\n##### SUMMARY\\r\\n\\u003c!-- Explain the problem/feature briefly --\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nI have created an lxc instance【OS：centos 7】 and it appears to have started normally from the system. I used virsh -c lxc:///list on the host to check that lxc is also running. However, when I used virsh -c lxc:///console i-2-3-VM to enter the container instance, I was unable to use it properly. The prompt message is: Failed to create symlink/sys/fs/cgroup/net_cls: Operation not allowed; Did I not set it up properly somewhere;\\r\\n\\r\\n2、\\r\\nI logged into the virtual router and pinged the lxc instance's IP address in the virtual router, but it still doesn't work\\r\\n\\u003cimg width=\\\"848\\\" alt=\\\"1732872762143\\\" src=\\\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5268116a-6e88-4906-be66-fe1eda50cd65\\\"\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cimg width=\\\"509\\\" alt=\\\"1732873018388\\\" src=\\\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/62ad7246-6d8d-4d71-b934-ff6daab9b29f\\\"\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cimg width=\\\"496\\\" alt=\\\"1732872892384\\\" src=\\\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbfd50b5-1a6b-44b3-9b34-6cc7b0860289\\\"\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\\r\\n\\u003c!--\\r\\nFor bugs, show exactly how to reproduce the problem, using a minimal test-case. Use Screenshots if accurate.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor new features, show how the feature would be used.\\r\\n--\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c!-- Paste example playbooks or commands between quotes below --\\u003e\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c!-- You can also paste gist.github.com links for larger files --\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\\r\\n\\u003c!-- What did you expect to happen when running the steps above? --\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n\\r\\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\\r\\n\\u003c!-- What actually happened? --\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c!-- Paste verbatim command output between quotes below --\\u003e\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"maic\",\"id\":468252,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2ODI1Mg==\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/468252?v=4\",\"html_ur