ommit ID for issues on main branch.\\r\\n--\\u003e\\r\\nACS 4.18.0.0\\r\\n\\r\\n##### CONFIGURATION\\r\\n\\u003c!--\\r\\nInformation about the configuration if relevant, e.g. basic network, advanced networking, etc.  N/A otherwise\\r\\n--\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n##### OS / ENVIRONMENT\\r\\n\\u003c!--\\r\\nInformation about the environment if relevant, N/A otherwise\\r\\n--\\u003e\\r\\nAlmaLinux8 MGMT+KVM\\r\\n\\r\\n##### SUMMARY\\r\\n\\u003c!-- Explain the problem/feature briefly --\\u003e\\r\\nNeeded multicast traffic to send or receive from user vm to vm.\\r\\n\\r\\n##### STEPS TO REPRODUCE\\r\\n\\u003c!--\\r\\nFor bugs, show exactly how to reproduce the problem, using a minimal test-case. Use Screenshots if accurate.\\r\\nFor new features, show how the feature would be used.\\r\\n--\\u003e\\r\\nI am not sure how to reproduce\\r\\n\\u003c!-- Paste example playbooks or commands between quotes below --\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c!-- You can also paste gist.github.com links for larger files --\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n##### EXPECTED RESULTS\\r\\n\\u003c!-- What did you expect to happen when running the steps above? --\\u003e\\r\\nEsxi system have this option like IGMP\\r\\nAs like below link \\r\\nhttps://prnt.sc/e_f5V9S3xgox\\r\\n\\r\\n##### ACTUAL RESULTS\\r\\n\\u003c!-- What actually happened? --\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c!-- Paste verbatim command output between quotes below --\\u003e\\r\\n~~~\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"alamintech\",\"id\":68062764,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDYyNzY0\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68062764?v=4\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/alamintech\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"type\":\"User\",\"site_admin\":false,\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/alamintech\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/alamintech/events{/privacy}\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/alamintech/following{/other_user}\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/alamintech/foll